 ## Background
-ParetoGS Continuous-Budget Decoding was introduced in the paper "ParetoGS: High-Quality Continuous-Budget 3D Gaussian Splatting with Sparse Adapted Anchors" [S1, unofficial]. It builds on the concept of adapted anchors and residual encoding to provide a flexible rendering pipeline.
